            "title": "Wild Flowers",
            "tagline": "Made for wandering",
            "description": "<p>For those who love taking the scenic route. This box brings together our fresh, floral-herbal Wild Flowers Anywhere Fragrance, a pair of everyday crew socks, a playlist made for wandering and a little ritual that encourages you to step outside and notice the world around you.</p><p>A reminder that sometimes the best discoveries happen when you're not looking for anything in particular.</p>",
