            "title": "Woodland Retreat",
            "tagline": "A reset for the senses",
            "description": "<p>A little escape inspired by the calm of the outdoors. Inside, you'll find our refreshing Woodland Retreat Anywhere Fragrance, a miniature body wash, two Lavender Yuzu Hojicha cold brew tea sachets, a feel-good playlist and a ritual that takes you from a refreshing shower to a leisurely walk outside.</p><p>Made for clearing your head, finding your pace and enjoying a little breathing room.</p>",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Postcard_Stamp_Illustrations_RGB_Woodland_Retreat_e6f4b29d-5e77-49da-92f5-5434f992df77.png",
