          "type": "world_box",
          "settings": {
            "number": "05",
            "title": "Bath House",
            "tagline": "Your own little bath ritual",
            "description": "<p>Turn an ordinary shower into a moment to look forward to. Inspired by the quiet warmth of a bath house, this box includes our woody, tea-infused Bath House Anywhere Fragrance, miniature body wash and shampoo in refillable aluminium bottles, a calming playlist and a ritual centred around warm water, slow breaths and letting the day wash away.</p><p>A little spa moment, without leaving home.</p>",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Postcard_Stamp_Illustrations_RGB_Bathhouse.png",
