          "type": "world_box",
          "settings": {
            "number": "06",
            "title": "Library Nest",
            "tagline": "One more chapter, please",
            "description": "<p>For anyone who loves getting lost in a good book. Inside, you'll find our Library Nest Anywhere Fragrance inspired by the scent of paper, ink and soft woods, a set of magnetic bookmarks, Uji Sencha green tea, a specially curated reading list, a reflective playlist and a ritual made for uninterrupted reading.</p><p>Everything you need to settle in, turn a page and forget about the time for a while.</p>",
